# Walkthrough - Unified MinIO Folder Structure

I have unified the project folder structure on MinIO. Now, all documents related to a specific bando (Tender) are stored within the same parent folder, regardless of whether they are uploads or generated proposal sections.

## Changes Made

### 1. Unified Path Logic in [naming.py](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/utils/naming.py)
Modified [naming.py](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/utils/naming.py) to use the tender's title and ID as the root for all project folders.
```python
def get_structured_minio_path(
    user_prefix: str, 
    tender_title: str, 
    tender_id: int, 
    ...
) -> str:
    project_folder = f"{sanitize_name(tender_title)}_{tender_id}"
    base_path = f"tenders/{sanitize_name(user_prefix)}/{project_folder}"
    ...
```

### 2. Updated Upload API
Updated [tenders.py](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/api/tenders.py) to always use the tender-based path for uploads, ensuring consistency even after a proposal is created.

### 3. Updated OnlyOffice Integration
Updated [onlyoffice.py](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/api/onlyoffice.py) to fetch tender details and use them for the document storage path. This ensures proposal sections are stored as siblings to the `uploaded` folder.

## Final Folder Structure
The resulting structure on MinIO will now be:
- [tenders/](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/api/tenders.py#173-221)
  - `{user_prefix}/`
    - `{TenderTitle}_{TenderID}/`
      - `uploaded/` (contains PDF uploads)
      - `proposal_documents/` (contains OnlyOffice .docx sections)

## Verification Results
- **Code Review**: Verified that both [tenders.py](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/api/tenders.py) and [onlyoffice.py](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/api/onlyoffice.py) now call the same path generation logic with the same root parameters (`tender.title`, `tender.id`).
- **Dependency Check**: Verified that the SQL queries correctly load the necessary [tender](file:///media/marco/DATA2/progettiAi/tenderwriter/backend/app/api/tenders.py#248-271) relationship to provide these details.
